# The OpenAPI document Scramble generates for the ENV-28 drift gate, and any
# other build artefact. The directory itself is committed — and only the
# directory — because `composer api:docs` is the documented one-command refresh
# path and it has to work on a clean checkout. It did not: `build/` existed only
# on the machine where it was first created by hand, and every Pest job in CI
# failed on the first push with
# "file_put_contents(build/openapi.generated.json): No such file or directory".
#
# Never commit the generated document itself. `docs/api.md` is the contract; a
# generated file sitting in the tree beside it is how someone eventually edits
# the wrong one.
*
!.gitignore
